activity Schedule Train
activity Update Schedule
activity Allocate Resources
activity Monitor Train
activity Manage Delay
activity Perform Maintenance
activity Inspect Track
activity Dispatch Train
activity Receive Train
activity Cancel Train
bind Schedule Train: Train ID, Schedule Version
bind Update Schedule: Train ID, Schedule Version
bind Allocate Resources: Train ID, Track Number
bind Monitor Train: Train ID, Status
bind Manage Delay: Train ID, Delay Duration
bind Perform Maintenance: Train ID, Maintenance Type
bind Inspect Track: Track Number, Inspection Score
bind Dispatch Train: Train ID, Priority Level
bind Receive Train: Train ID, Passenger Count
bind Cancel Train: Train ID, Reason
Train ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Schedule Version: integer between 1 and 100
Track Number: integer between 1 and 10
Status: On Time, Delayed, Cancelled, Completed
Delay Duration: float between 0.0 and 300.0
Maintenance Type: Routine, Emergency, Scheduled
Inspection Score: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Priority Level: High, Medium, Low
Passenger Count: integer between 0 and 1500
Reason: Weather, Maintenance, Technical Issue
Init[Schedule Train] | |
Precedence[Allocate Resources, Dispatch Train] | |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Response[Monitor Train, Manage Delay] |A.Status is Delayed |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Chain Precedence[Perform Maintenance, Dispatch Train] | |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Succession[Inspect Track, Allocate Resources] | |A.Track Number == T.Track Number |
Responded Existence[Dispatch Train, Receive Train] | |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Not Co-Existence[Dispatch Train, Cancel Train] | |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Not Chain Succession[Update Schedule, Schedule Train] | |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Exclusive Choice[Dispatch Train, Cancel Train] | |A.Train ID == T.Train ID |
Absence2[Cancel Train] | |